From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: seven7sas <zazad2288@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 02:00:01 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] Fork server optimizations and async refactoring

- Async player.dat, stats and advancements login preloading and CriterionTrigger.Listener hashCode caching

- Lock-free async entity lookup in ServerLevel and ChunkEntitySlices plus O(1) PoiType lookup and PoiManager direct loop

- Parallel brain sensing, parallel entity collisions, lazy container item loading and cached PalettedContainerFactory

- Smooth chunk send ramp-up without area-map shrinking and ChunkMap tracked entities optimization

